    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/39329/websize_celeste_levis__large.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A holiday tradition that continues for a 7th year! \n\nBack at the NAC, Céleste Lévis invites you to an enchanting, heartwarming evening for the whole family. Joined by her band, she’ll perform a blend of original holiday songs she has created over the years, along with timeless Christmas classics — all delivered with her signature voice, both gentle and powerful. \n\nSet in an intimate atmosphere around a piano — just like in her early days at her grandfather’s — Céleste offers a..."
      }
