        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Inn Echo |  Fri, Dec 5, 2025, 8:00 pm | Fourth Stage"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/39327/websize_inn_echo__large.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "2025 JUNO nominee!\n\nThe allure of a vibrant traditional music scene brought Karson McKeown (Ottawa, ON), Tuli Porcher (Victoria, BC) and Tom Gammons (Butte, MT) to Prince Edward Island. They met in a typical folky way: at a session in a local pub. Inn Echo emerged in 2019, a transcontinental love story between fiddle, cello and guitar. \n\nIt’s not just differences in hometown that bring new flavours into the mix. The trio have a special combination of musical personalities. Karson’s fiddle playing..."
      }
    ],
