        "@value": "Matthew Byrne |  Fri, Nov 28, 2025, 8:00 pm | Fourth Stage"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/39454/byrne_web__large.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Storytelling through song is a fundamental duty of traditional music, and Matthew does this brilliantly. With parents who were singers and song collectors, he was raised with a strong family focus on sharing songs, and he has cultivated a distinctive repertoire and deep appreciation for rediscovering and reinventing traditional material. Since releasing his debut album Ballads in 2010, Byrne has established himself as one of Canada’s foremost traditional singers with his rich and powerful vocals, refined guitar style, and compelling..."
      }
