    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Cadence Weapon returns for a tour commemorating the 20th anniversary of his Polaris Prize-nominated landmark debut album, Breaking Kayfabe, which was recently included on the Globe and Mail's list of 101 Canadian albums that represent the country’s musical impact and The Toronto Star's list of 17 Canadian albums that shaped the sound of the 2000s. Since that album first came out, Cadence Weapon has published a memoir called Bedroom Rapper, became poet laureate of Edmonton and went on to win the 2021 Polaris Prize...."
      }
