    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Lang Lang & Alexander Shelley | with the NAC Orchestra |  Mon, Sep 29, 2025, 8:00 pm | Southam Hall"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/38430/1__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Three things to know:\n\n\n\tLang Lang is a global superstar whose electrifying performances have made him one of the most celebrated pianists of our time.\n\tWhen war overwhelmed the streets of Vienna, Beethoven took refuge in a basement to compose his glorious “Emperor” Concerto.\n\tComposer Richard Wagner said of Beethoven’s spirited 7th Symphony that even “children in the cradle will fall to dancing!”\n\n\nExperience a pair of works by Ludwig van Beethoven that offer timeless messages of hope and resilience, despite being composed during a time of personal and political..."
      }
