    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Please note that Under30 tickets for these performances are limited.\n\nThree things to know:\n\n\n\tBack by popular demand, Troupe Vertigo returns to Southam Hall for an evening of dazzling acrobatics and symphonic music. \n\t“Our works are very much about ... making the extraordinary somehow touchable,” says Troupe Vertigo co-founder Aloysia Gavre. Enjoy a spellbinding program featuring music from Wicked, the Harry Potter films and more! \n\tThe Los Angeles Times has hailed Troupe Vertigo performances as “dizzying acts that defy gravity and leave its lucky audiences in awe.” \n\n\nWhat..."
