    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A beloved holiday tradition returns to Southam Hall: Handel’s Messiah, performed by the NAC Orchestra and a cast of exceptional artists, with a special spotlight on Canadian talent. Gather your closest friends and loved ones for an evening of music and celebration that everyone will enjoy!\n\nFew compositions kindle the warmth and spirit of the holiday season like George Frideric Handel’s Messiah and its electrifying “Hallelujah” chorus. Evoking the theatrical splendour that has made Messiah a favourite of audiences around the world..."
      }
