    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Disney’s The Muppet Christmas Carol, Live in Concert | with the NAC Orchestra | Dec 11 - 13, 2025 | Southam Hall"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/38421/dic_mcc_6__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Presented in English with French subtitles\nPlease note that Under30 tickets are limited for these performances.\n\nThe National Arts Centre Orchestra presents Disney’s The Muppet Christmas Carol in Concert featuring a screening of the film while the musical score is performed live by the orchestra!\n\nThe Muppets perform Charles Dickens’s classic holiday tale, with Kermit the Frog playing Bob Cratchit, the put-upon clerk of stingy Ebenezer Scrooge (Michael Caine). Gonzo, as Dickens, narrates the story with the help of Rizzo the Rat. The film also..."
      }
